220 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 75 0 R
/E (I had this conversation on the podcast with Bob Byrnes, who has spent over fifteen years building pricing structures at Kenco, Ryder, and Stord, and now teaches the Economics of Warehousing course at IWLA. He put something to me that has stuck with me since:)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
