/Title (Revenue is not profitability. A customer generating two hundred thousand dollars a year that costs two hundred and twenty thousand to serve is not one of your biggest accounts. It is a subsidy, funded by the other sixteen. And every hour spent managing that account is an hour not spent on the accounts actually carrying the business.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1253 0 R
/Prev 1435 0 R
/Next 1338 0 R
>>
