/Title (This is not a mistake in operations. It is a mistake in the pricing conversation nobody had. The real question was never can we win this account. It was: is revenue our goal here, or is margin our goal here. If margin, the better move might be a smaller footprint, a subleased corner of the new space, or simply declining the account until the timing is better.)
