/Title (The unprofitable accounts are rarely the obvious troublemakers. They are not late payers. They are not difficult people. Often they are long-standing relationships, comfortable ones, with consistent volume and a customer who is pleasant to deal with. Everything about the relationship feels right except the economics, and the economics are invisible because nobody has ever isolated what it actually costs to serve that one account.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1253 0 R
/Prev 1434 0 R
/Next 1397 0 R
