/Title (Here is the math nobody runs before signing. If the second building is roughly the same size as the first, winning this one customer means you now operate one building near full and a second building running at ten percent utilization. Rent on that second building does not scale down because only one customer is in it. The revenue from that one account is not going to cover the fixed cost of an entire additional facility, not for a long time, possibly not ever if growth stalls.)
